name plainyr
category Package
revision 52783
shortdesc Plain bibliography style, sorted by year first
longdesc This is a version of the standard plain BibTeX style, modified
longdesc to sort chronologically (by year) first, then by author, title,
longdesc etc. (The style's name isn't what the author submitted: it was
longdesc renamed for clarity.)
